provoking and kind of scary.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:08:59.663
- Yeah.

00:08:59.663 --> 00:09:03.450
Like for your character and
then also for the parents.

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:06.300
It's, yeah. 'Cause love changes.

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:09.360
- Yeah. I mean, it's a story about love,

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:11.010
you know, and all different kinds of love.

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:14.190
I mean my character,
she is or thinks she is

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:15.660
like ready to get
married, ready to commit.

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.070
Her boyfriend is scared.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.094
