00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:30.720
by the end of the movie.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:33.240
- And even how they all-
- Connect.

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.767
- Connect.

00:09:34.767 --> 00:09:35.980
I was like, no.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:37.200
I was literally in my..

